I tell Amit, Neha, and Sanjay my story.
I arrived in Mumbai in January.
I came here for my software job.
That day, I came out of the airport.
I had a suitcase in my hand.
I also had a bag with me.
That suitcase was very heavy.
I saw a taxi driver on the street.
I went near him.
I was a little nervous in the new city.
I had my phone in my hand.
My new home's address was on the phone.
I showed that address to the driver.
That driver read the address.
Then he said to me, 'Madam, please sit inside.'
He placed my suitcase and bag in the vehicle.
Then I sat in the taxi.
The taxi went towards my new home.
Amit, Neha, and Sanjay happily listen to my story.
